Spelling, capitalization and a preceding separator distinguish short fragments.
Adaptation, admission, adoption, acquisition and nearby A-initial word families
are negative; signal words are positive. A few Chinese equivalents are covered.
Chat-format closing tags form a smaller positive feature. All other tokens are
left at zero; this does not reproduce the many small unrelated lexical effects.
