determiners ("the four investigated", "these three commercial", "five defensive
tackles") push the component strongly negative. It is strongest right after "the",
"these", "his" and similar, and weak in coordinations and ranges ("between two and",
"or three", "first two", "to four"). Ordinals third to sixth are mildly negative,
the large-unit words hundred, thousand and century are positive, and subscript
digits (₁ ₂ ...) are mildly positive. Everything else is 0."""

