"""A negative side-of-something signal, strongest for a specified side.

The noun 'side(s)' has a large response, amplified by left/right, paired
sides, and other spatial modifiers. 'Of' immediately after it continues
the response. Listed side translations also fire. Related lateral words
and spelling fragments usually get smaller signals; other tokens get
zero. These are training-fitted approximations, not a semantic parser.
"""
